  "tags": [{ "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z", "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z", "id": "whatsapp-agent", "name": "WhatsApp Agent" }],
  "notes": "## What This Does\nWhen a new lead arrives (from your website form, CRM, etc.):\n1. Saves the contact in the agent's memory\n2. Creates a follow-up task\n3. Sends an instant WhatsApp notification to the owner\n\n## Setup\n1. Set AGENT_URL and OWNER_PHONE env vars in n8n\n2. Create HTTP Header Auth credential 'Agent API Key'\n3. Connect your form/CRM to POST to this webhook URL\n\n## Input Format\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"phone\": \"0501234567\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"source\": \"website\",\n  \"notes\": \"Interested in product X\"\n}\n```"
}
